NeoBAE for Minecraft
====================

This work is a Minecraft mod that integrates the NeoBAE / miniBAE audio
engine with the Etched mod by Humble Abode / jackson / Ocelot / Farcr.

Contains:

  * Source code targeting Etched's public API
    (gg.moonflower.etched.api.*) - Etched is © 2021 Moonflower Studio,
    licensed under GPL-3.0-only.
    https://github.com/jacksonhardaway/etched

  * Compiled bindings into the NeoBAE / miniBAE engine, which is itself
    BSD-3-Clause licensed and lives in the parent repository
    (../../../). See ../../../LICENSE.

No textures, models, sounds, translations, or other assets from Etched
are bundled in this mod. Players are expected to install Etched
separately (it is declared as a hard dependency in neoforge.mods.toml).
